You open all steam valves at once, releasing a radius 3 wave of superheated steam around yourself which deals [204, 274, 329, 375, 416 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire damage (but can not be a critical hit).

If you had at least 35 steam, the vapours will be so hot that they can burn sensory organs, blinding affected creatures for [2, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns.

The effects scale with your current steam value; at 1 steam they are only 15% as effective as at 50 or more (current factor 100%).
